CHRONOFLUX ATTRIBUTION
----------------------

The Chronoflux Principia — realised by Roy D Herbert — is incorporated as a
core mechanical part of the Perccent ledger, block evolution, and wallet
settlement logic. The hydrodynamic constructs and continuum mechanics that
drive Perccent microblock verification derive from and operate through that
Principia.

This software and associated documentation (the "Software"), including the
Perccent wallet application, internet seed node (`perc_chain`), build outputs,
and related materials, are proprietary intellectual property of the copyright
holder unless otherwise stated below. Rights in the Chronoflux Principia remain
with Roy D Herbert; rights in this Software implementation remain with the
copyright holder named above.


